WEBVTT

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:10.630
I am so callow.

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:16.010
There is so much I do not know.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:20.430
For instance...

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:27.190
Vanitas, I wanted to ask you something.

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:30.530
Well, out with it.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:33.860
What in the devil is love?

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:45.540
"The Case Study of Vanitas"

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:53.380
<i>You're pondering the simple things,</i>
<i>pretty much: human emotions, and love?</i>

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:57.760
<i>I hope one day you'll understand</i>

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:02.350
<i>Too many wounds have left you</i>
<i>patched together, a miserable sight</i>

00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:07.600
<i>That doesn't even know</i>
<i>the definition of "alive"</i>

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:15.110
<i>No need to say,</i>
<i>"Just the two of us" or anything</i>

00:01:15.110 --> 00:01:23.700
<i>I've a feeling we can understand</i>
<i>each other, and that's fine for now</i>

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:32.670
<i>I love this world,</i>
<i>and the light only you give me</i>

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:37.550
<i>Makes the world I see</i>
<i>through these fractured eyes </i>

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:42.220
<i>Look gleaming and bright</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:46.810
<i>There's no such thing as a sure thing</i>

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:51.520
<i>But you can see me, can't you?</i>

00:01:55.070 --> 00:02:00.410
<i>When sky and void meet, look back</i>
<i>because the dreams will come later</i>

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:09.120
T-Tarte Tatin!

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:14.460
I didn't think he'd get <i>this </i>excited.

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:18.260
Noé has always been
a sucker for Tarte Tatin.

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:22.010
Thank you for letting me know, Dominique.

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:24.260
It's an honor to be of service.

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:26.680
Tarte Tatin!

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:31.940
Um, may I dig in?

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:34.070
Of course.

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:38.280
It's so good!

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:50.290
My teacher often brought Tarte Tatin home
as a gift from trips to the human world.

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:54.420
But I never imagined
I'd have it in Altus Paris!

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:58.090
They say a vampire who
fancied it as much as you

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:01.800
brought the recipe back
from the human world.

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:07.640
Don't tell me that said
vampire was my lord uncle.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:15.860
Thank you for taking me to such
a magnificent restaurant, Luca.

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:19.320
No need to thank me.
You came all this way to visit.

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:21.820
Apologies for my uncle's absence.

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:27.660
It's quite all right. I'm glad we'll have
plenty of time for a meeting tomorrow.

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:33.460
I have lots of questions about
what went on after the ball.

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:35.290
Noé.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:38.880
I'm really grateful for last night.

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:45.850
Thanks to you, my life and the lives
of many other vampires were saved.

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:53.650
No, I didn't do anything.

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:56.020
Too sweet!

00:03:56.020 --> 00:04:00.360
I must thank you as well, Noé.

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:04.860
You protected Master Luca in my absence.

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:07.160
I am truly grateful.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:11.710
Actually...

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.750
You have it all wrong.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:20.380
It was not I who ended the turmoil.
It was Vanitas's power.

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.850
Of course, I'm aware of that.

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:33.770
No curse-bearers had to be beheaded,
and that is without a doubt thanks to him.

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:36.560
However, Vanitas!

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:41.320
Before I convey my gratitude, I want
you to apologize for the other day!

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:43.900
Apologize? Whatever for?

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:47.570
The day we first met...
you know... with Jeanne!

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:49.080
Umm...

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.370
You forced yourself on her!

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:54.290
Oh, you mean the kiss?

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:58.590
Th-That's right.

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:01.630
You can start by apologizing for that.

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:02.550
My bad.

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:04.630
No, not like that!

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:07.050
You're a real pain in the keister.

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:10.390
To whom am I apologizing, anyway?

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:13.350
To Jeanne or to you?

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:16.850
T-To Jeanne, of course.

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:21.520
I see. In that case,
there is no need to apologize.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:24.900
Jeanne and I are in love with each other.

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:27.530
Keep your fantasies to yourself.

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:31.120
I'm not fantasizing.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:34.330
See? Feast your eyes.

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:38.750
Jeanne and I already share
that sort of relationship.

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:43.760
He's marked!

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:45.550
Th-That's Jeanne's?

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:48.800
That's right. It is the mark
left when vampires imbue

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:53.350
the victims of their bloodlust
with some of their power.

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:56.520
He lies! I don't remember
doing any such thing!

00:05:56.520 --> 00:06:00.860
Now, now, you must at least
recognize your own mark.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:04.860
Then again, you <i>were </i>quite rough.

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:08.910
It's no surprise your memory is spotty.

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:14.160
It was like you were in a trance
the way you greedily fed.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:17.370
Was my blood really so delicious?

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:21.250
So much so that you left
this mark upon me?

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:26.340
Jeanne, did you really suck his blood?

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:27.630
Master Luca!

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:30.300
Is this the sort of man you like?!

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:32.800
Huh? Where did that come from?

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:34.680
It's true, isn't it?!

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:39.350
How could you leave your mark on
a member of the Blue Moon Clan?!

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:42.730
It's as if you're claiming
him as your own!

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:45.110
Th-That's...!

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:47.240
That's...

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:54.740
Sorry! Sorry! It seems
I took the jest too far.

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:56.750
What?

00:06:56.750 --> 00:07:04.710
Luca, this certainly is Jeanne's mark,
but she did not wish to leave it.

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:07.550
Are you saying you forced her?

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:10.720
Listen. Calm down. You're scaring me.

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:13.760
She wasn't in her right mind at the time.

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:16.100
You all heard them.

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:19.350
The curse bearer's voices.

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:24.480
Like the other vampires,

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:29.280
it was a momentary lapse
of control that made her attack me.

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:31.650
Is that true, Jeanne?

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:35.660
Yes, Master Luca.

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:40.210
Forgive me for not reporting
the matter to you.

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:42.960
I see! So that's what happened!

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:44.500
What a relief!

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:45.750
That explains it.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.920
Unless you had lost control,

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:53.390
you would never leave your mark on a
terribly rude, selfish man such as him!

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:58.010
Why, Luca, I'm getting a distinct
feeling you don't like me.

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:03.060
I am so glad you're all right, Jeanne.

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:11.570
Forgive me, Master Luca!
I'll bring him back when I'm done!

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:12.990
Jeanne?!

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:33.630
Noé?

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:36.140
I'll go after them!

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:37.970
Noé?!

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:41.390
Why is everyone leaving
through the window?

00:08:46.060 --> 00:08:48.230
Why did you tell such a lie?

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:52.900
What? Should I have told the truth?

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:57.530
From what I could tell, it didn't
seem like you wanted Luca to know

00:08:57.530 --> 00:09:00.830
you were stricken with
the urge to suck blood.

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:03.370
So I made something up.

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:08.540
I've asked you before, Jeanne.

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:11.340
Are you a curse-bearer?

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:17.550
You've no intention of saying, eh?

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:21.010
It doesn't always happen like that.

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:26.900
I can suppress my thirst for blood
as long as I take my medicine.

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:31.820
But its effect wore off quickly that day.

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:36.150
I never heard of such a medicine.
How interesting.

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:39.570
Listen, human.

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:42.660
Do not speak a word of this to anyone.

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:44.000
I beg you.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:47.420
Please. Do not speak of this!

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:59.800
Have no fear, Jeanne.

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:05.390
I'm not the kind of man who spills
the secrets of the woman I love.

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:10.810
But I have two conditions.

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:11.940
Conditions?

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:13.230
That's right.

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:16.320
I won't tell anyone your secret.

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:18.320
In exchange...

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:25.700
You must not suck the
blood of anyone but me.

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:27.460
What?!

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:35.510
M-Must you set such a condition?!

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:38.130
It's really quite simple.

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:43.140
Having you suck my blood
felt truly divine.

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:45.930
Wait! What? What?!

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:50.350
Having my blood sucked never
rocked me to the core till that day.

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:52.400
It was truly incredible.

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:55.070
The pleasurable effect
of vampire bites results

00:10:55.070 --> 00:10:58.240
from the aphrodisiac-like
substance injected by their fangs.

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:01.280
But its efficacy may differ
by the vampire's power

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:03.410
and compatibility with the victim.

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:06.870
Vampires inject this
substance to keep them still

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:09.250
while sucking their blood.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:13.710
Some vampire bites cause sleep, paralysis,
or other non-pleasurable effects.

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:15.420
But much of that is
still a mystery, and I--

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:17.590
Too much information!

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:22.470
What I'm saying is we have
superb physical chemistry.

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:27.430
You no good...! Stop saying things
that can be taken out of context!

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:33.650
This is marvelous! Being with you
sets my heart aflutter!

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:40.650
If you ever thirst for blood,
just say the word.

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:44.200
I'll give you all you want.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:49.330
No. I mustn't think about it.

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:59.590
His blood tasted so very sweet.

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:03.180
You said...

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:04.840
Hm?

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:08.930
You said there were two conditions.
What is the second one?

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:11.430
Oh, that's right.

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:18.820
From now on, I want you to say my
name rather than calling me "human."

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:26.530
Vanitas.

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:06.450
Noé?

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:08.740
They're back.

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:11.910
Yes, I saw them.

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:21.760
What's the matter, Mon Chéri?

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:25.010
You look as if you'll cry.

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:27.970
Domi, I...

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:31.720
Since hearing that Jeanne
sucked Vanitas's blood,

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:34.980
I've had an agonizing feeling in my chest.

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:43.610
I thought about why that is.

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:47.450
And this is what I found.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:51.700
I was...

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:58.630
I was vexed that Jeanne got to him first!

00:13:58.630 --> 00:13:59.540
What?

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:04.590
I always thought Vanitas's
blood smelled really good.

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:08.840
Had I known this would happen,
I'd have had him give me a taste!

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:13.720
It's such fine blood, Jeanne
marked him to have it all to herself!

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:17.270
Can you imagine how
scrumptious it must be?!

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:22.320
Seriously? You really are a handful.

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:24.030
Domi?!

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:27.450
D-Domi! What are you...?

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:28.320
Hush!

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:31.830
Men like you should be
gnawed on by women like me!

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:35.250
Stop. That tickles my ear!

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:42.210
You've no idea how I feel.

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:19.460
I already knew.

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:22.500
Your blood is delectable.

00:15:32.010 --> 00:15:35.390
Noé, you are such a fool.

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:36.810
Huh?

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:53.410
This place really livens up after sundown.

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:06.040
--Shall we--
--Jeanne!

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:07.300
Let's dance!

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:08.670
Huh?

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:13.890
Nothing wrong with
tormenting him a little.

00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:15.680
Um, Mademoiselle Dominique?

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:16.510
Hm?

00:16:16.510 --> 00:16:19.020
You must know of me.

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:23.100
Should you be seen
dancing with a bourreau,

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:27.270
it shall do harm to your good name.

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:29.610
Good grief, a goody-two-shoes.

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:31.030
What?

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:38.330
"Acts of pleasure come first and foremost
before all of one's other passions."

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.290
My father's words.

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:46.290
So I enjoy beautiful flowers
blooming before my eyes.

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:49.090
I'm not one to put off such pleasure

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:51.920
for some future passion of mine.

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:10.610
You don't want to dance with Jeanne?

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:13.400
I'm not a very good dancer.

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:17.660
It would be a pity if
I ended up stepping on her foot.

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:23.910
Then shall I teach you?

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:29.340
All right.

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:31.840
I accept.

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:36.840
Master Luca.

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:38.970
Are you all right?

00:17:40.310 --> 00:17:42.430
She's so lucky.

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:46.600
I can't wait to grow up.

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:52.690
Huh? So you <i>can </i>dance.

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:55.280
I never said I couldn't.

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:03.500
Vanitas, I wanted to ask you something.

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:07.920
Well, out with it.

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:12.710
What in the devil is love?

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:17.760
That ham-fisted invitation to
dance was due to a question?!

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:21.470
I knew you had something on your mind!

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:23.680
That's your question?

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:32.110
I have no idea.

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:34.070
But when I see Jeanne,

00:18:34.070 --> 00:18:38.410
my heart quickens,
and I can't stop trembling.

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:48.580
For me, at least, I've defined
that feeling as love.

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:51.170
It's more interesting that way.

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:55.340
A racing heart and a trembling body...

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:58.170
It sounds like a nasty cold.

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:02.390
You're right. It <i>is </i>like catching a cold.

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:23.370
Vanitas, what is it you like about Jeanne?

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:27.290
She's strong and beautiful.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:30.420
She's awkward and delicate.

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:34.670
She has an ample bosom
and is a joy to tease.

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:38.420
And what else? Let's see...

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:43.180
It doesn't seem like she'll ever love me.

00:19:44.350 --> 00:19:46.140
I don't understand.

00:19:46.140 --> 00:19:52.100
When you love someone,
don't you want them to love you back?

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:54.650
That is not what I seek.

00:19:55.820 --> 00:20:01.570
Jeanne need not love me,
even though I love her.

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:10.910
I have zero interest in the sort
of person who would love me.

00:20:13.210 --> 00:20:17.170
There is still much I do not understand.

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:23.970
Why?

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:27.260
Why has my heart been sent aflutter?

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:31.980
My ignorance abounds.

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:34.940
Oh, forgive me.

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:37.520
You can do better than, "Oh, forgive me"!

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:39.650
It wasn't on purpose.

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:42.240
At any rate,

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:45.370
you're visiting Lord Ruthven
though you know nothing about him.

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:47.120
You truly are...

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:50.200
I know he is a member of the Senate.

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:52.330
He's far more than that!

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:57.880
Lord Ruthven is a moderate who helped end
the war between vampires and humans.

00:20:57.880 --> 00:20:59.880
He's a peacemaker.

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:03.680
To this day, there are many
who praise him as a hero.

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:05.180
How marvelous.

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:09.510
So then you know nothing
about Master Lucius, either?

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:10.270
--Huh?

00:21:10.270 --> 00:21:11.600
--Never mind.
--Huh?

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:14.770
He'll wish to tell you himself, no doubt.

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:18.650
Perhaps I should go, too.

00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:23.240
No, Domi. You received an urgent
summons from the House of de Sade.

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:29.580
I had good intentions
when I brought you to Altus,

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:32.830
but I ended up dragging
you into a big mess.

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:35.290
Why are you apologizing?

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:41.590
Domi, you always show your concern for me.

00:21:41.590 --> 00:21:45.880
It makes me happy to know that.

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:49.140
All right.

00:21:49.140 --> 00:21:52.350
